{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#918","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#918","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#918\",\"parent_revision\":\"ef367158b4021d8ec972df5ea776e7f072bf5a85\",\"root_revision\":\"0c652ecd3e6a1355f824e4bea92ee756fb623be407ce2d1534edc3a33ce9bf22\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P2\\ntype: Chore\\nstatus: open\\nadded: 2026-08-12\\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nTwo test gaps found in code review: (1) list_milestones is missing a state validation test (list_issues has one but milestones does not), (2) list_issues milestone title resolution happy path has no test. Low risk since the code exists \u2014 only test coverage is absent.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>2026-03-20T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>2026-03-20T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **maintainer of the project infrastructure**, I want to **add missing test coverage for milestone state validation and issue milestone resolution** so that **the project infrastructure stays healthy**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Code review 2026-03-20 \u2014 P782 follow-up from backlog-mcp-github-tools feature\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-03-20\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\\n## Groomed (2026-03-30)\\n\\n### Priority\\n\\n6/10 \u2014 Code exists and works; this is coverage-only. Low risk. Builds maintainer confidence and guards against future regressions.\\n\\n### Impact\\n\\n- Blocks: Nothing immediately blocked.\\n- Bottleneck: Absent tests mean a future refactor of `list_milestones` state guard or `_resolve_milestone_number` can silently break without CI catching it.\\n\\n### Benefits\\n\\n- Closes the test symmetry gap between `list_issues` (has state validation test) and `list_milestones` (does not).\\n- Provides a regression guard for the milestone title resolution happy path in `list_issues`.\\n- Makes coverage reporting accurate for `operations.py` lines 3200\u20133202 and 3349\u20133351.\\n\\n### Expected Behavior\\n\\n1. `list_milestones(state=\\\"invalid\\\")` raises `ValidationError` with a message matching `\\\"state must be one of\\\"`.\\n2. `list_issues(milestone=\\\"v1.0\\\")` with a repo containing a milestone titled `\\\"v1.0\\\"` returns only the issues belonging to that milestone, resolving the title to a milestone number via `_resolve_milestone_number`.\\n\\n### Desired Structure\\n\\nTwo new test functions added to their respective existing test files:\\n- `test_list_milestones_invalid_state_raises_validation_error` in `/home/user/claude_skills/plugins/development-harness/tests/test_github_tools_milestones.py`\\n- `test_list_issues_milestone_title_resolution_returns_filtered_issues` in `/home/user/claude_skills/plugins/development-harness/tests/test_github_tools_issues.py`\\n\\nNo new files, no new helpers, no changes to `operations.py`.\\n\\n### Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n1. `uv run pytest plugins/development-harness/tests/test_github_tools_milestones.py -k test_list_milestones_invalid_state_raises_validation_error` passes.\\n2. `uv run pytest plugins/development-harness/tests/test_github_tools_issues.py -k test_list_issues_milestone_title_resolution_returns_filtered_issues` passes.\\n3. No existing tests regress (`uv run pytest plugins/development-harness/tests/` exits 0).\\n4. `uv run prek run --files plugins/development-harness/tests/test_github_tools_milestones.py plugins/development-harness/tests/test_github_tools_issues.py` exits 0.\\n\\n### Resources\\n\\n| Type | Item |\\n|------|------|\\n| Prior work | /home/user/claude_skills/plugins/development-harness/tests/test_github_tools_milestones.py |\\n| Prior work | /home/user/claude_skills/plugins/development-harness/tests/test_github_tools_issues.py |\\n| Prior work | /home/user/claude_skills/plugins/development-harness/backlog_core/operations.py (lines 3178\u20133219 `list_milestones`, lines 3339\u20133353 `_resolve_milestone_number`, lines 3409\u20133450 `list_issues`) |\\n\\n### Dependencies\\n\\n- Depends on: None\\n- Blocks: None\\n\\n### Effort\\n\\nSmall \u2014 Two test functions following patterns already established in the same files. No production code changes. Estimated 30\u201345 minutes.\\n\\n### Implementation Notes\\n\\n**Test 1 \u2014 `test_list_milestones_invalid_state_raises_validation_error`**\\n\\nFile: `tests/test_github_tools_milestones.py`, place after `test_list_milestones_passes_state_filter` (line 173).\\n\\nPattern to follow: `test_list_issues_invalid_state_raises_validation_error` in `test_github_tools_issues.py` (line 220).\\n\\nKey details:\\n- Mock `get_github` via `monkeypatch.setattr(\\\"backlog_core.operations.get_github\\\", lambda repo=None: MagicMock())`\\n- Call `list_milestones(state=\\\"invalid\\\")`\\n- Assert `pytest.raises(ValidationError, match=\\\"state must be one of\\\")`\\n- The exact error template is: `f\\\"state must be one of {sorted(valid_states)!r}, got {state!r}\\\"` (operations.py line 3201)\\n\\n**Test 2 \u2014 `test_list_issues_milestone_title_resolution_returns_filtered_issues`**\\n\\nFile: `tests/test_github_tools_issues.py`, place in the operation-layer section.\\n\\nPattern to follow: `test_list_issues_returns_expected_fields` (lines 64\u2013130) for overall structure; `_make_milestone` helper in `test_github_tools_milestones.py` shows the GraphQL mock shape for milestones.\\n\\nKey details:\\n- `_resolve_milestone_number` fetches milestones via `gh_repo.requester.graphql_query` (the GraphQL path, not `get_milestones`)\\n- The mock for `requester.graphql_query` must return a milestone node with `title=\\\"v1.0\\\"` and `number=1` in the milestones shape\\n- Then `_collect_issues` is called with `milestone_number=1`; mock `get_issues` to return one issue\\n- Assert the returned issue list is non-empty and the `milestone` field on the issue reflects the resolved title\\n- The GraphQL milestone node shape required: `{\\\"id\\\": \\\"M_1\\\", \\\"number\\\": 1, \\\"title\\\": \\\"v1.0\\\", \\\"state\\\": \\\"OPEN\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"dueOn\\\": null, \\\"issues\\\": {\\\"totalCount\\\": 1}, \\\"closedIssues\\\": {\\\"totalCount\\\": 0}}`\\n- `get_milestones` on the REST side can return `[]` (unused when GraphQL path is active)\\n\\n## Artifact Manifest\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n<!-- artifact-manifest:begin -->\\n| Type | Path | Status | Agent | Created |\\n|------|------|--------|-------|---------|\\n| task-plan | plan/P782-backlog-mcp-github-tools-followup-2.yaml | current | dh_migrate | 2026-03-24T16:36:12Z |\\n<!-- artifact-manifest:end -->\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"fa0ad59bea268fa159446aadeabefce973a86ed329ae8054234b8f758c4777b0\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABPgycAw\"}"}